WEBVTT

00:06:58.417 --> 00:07:00.643
that there is nothing you can do

00:07:00.667 --> 00:07:03.768
to prevent yourself
from being taken advantage of

00:07:03.792 --> 00:07:06.643
by someone who should know better.

00:07:06.667 --> 00:07:08.059
But at the same time,

00:07:08.083 --> 00:07:10.143
I want them to believe they have the power

00:07:10.167 --> 00:07:12.417
to stop someone
from taking advantage of them.

00:07:13.417 --> 00:07:16.458
I want them to feel ownership
of their bodies.

00:07:17.375 --> 00:07:20.143
I want to tell my kids
that I can protect them,

00:07:20.167 --> 00:07:22.333
and I want to believe that.

00:07:23.583 --> 00:07:25.768
But buried beneath
all those good intentions

00:07:25.792 --> 00:07:27.101
and motherly instincts

00:07:27.125 --> 00:07:28.417
is that same shame.

00:07:29.375 --> 00:07:33.875
If I tell my kids that there's something
they can do to prevent sexual assault,